HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0027.fits, spectra0028.fits,          HISTORY spectra0029.fits, spectra0030.fits, spectra0031.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0032.fits, spectra0033.fits, spectra0034.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0035.fits, spectra0036.fits, spectra0037.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0038.fits, spectra0039.fits, spectra0040.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0041.fits, spectra0042.fits, spectra0043.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0044.fits were combined using a robust weighted mean             HISTORY with a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The             HISTORY scale factors were determined using order 1 and are:                    HISTORY 0.9933613992300778, 0.9679920181151686, 0.9119504762118295,             HISTORY 1.0061098153775834, 0.9693038522954955, 0.9939639430100509,             HISTORY 1.0135100776554034, 1.0714577606049533, 1.0137053949380226,             HISTORY 1.1384155657967066, 1.0381433757748422, 0.9683761373925589,             HISTORY 0.9842117384626775, 1.1483224735482742, 0.9279665399253311,             HISTORY 1.2477950034956193, 0.9071492384725, 1.0973718779796204.                END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             